<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts 4 gold cos, cuts 4.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts 4 gold cos, cuts 4.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Leanne Baker said she initiated coverage of Cambior Inc, Getchell Gold Corp, Lihir Gold Ltd and Royal Oak Mines Inc with hold recommendations.  </p>
<p>-- said downgraded Echo Bay Mines Ltd and Battle Mountain Gold Co to hold from buy ratings, based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- said downgraded Santa Fe Pacific Gold Corp and Pegasus Gold Inc to buy from strong buy ratings.</p>
</text>
